{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nThe core working hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]][[cite:obs-f9757bf8baa5c4a56810adcbda83d5070d3b3b50 \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].\n\nThe staff handbook states core hours as from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days[[cite:obs-f9757bf8baa5c4a56810adcbda83d5070d3b3b50 \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].\n\nHowever, the board resolution takes precedence over the staff handbook in case of any differences[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"2ae1323bd39b8f2b34f75bfe077f9282aa8aef1a95360f7fe8e1af54a925ec12","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Clarified that the core working hours are 09:00 to 15:00 per the board resolution, and that the resolution takes precedence over the staff handbook, with all statements properly cited from the given sources."}